% snlicense -v failover
- Found existing license: failover
- License expiration:     Thu Nov  1 23:59:59 2012
- Actual expiration:      Thu Nov  1 23:59:59 2012
- The failover license status is: Good
.fi
.in -0.5i

.PP
Expired license:
.PP
.in +0.5i
.nf
% snlicense failover
